title            : Eigenvalue ratios for vibrating String equations with concave densities
updated          : 2021-11-15T12:42:10Z
link             : {link, link}
summary          : In this paper, we prove the optimal lower bound $\frac{λ_n}{λ_m}\geq(\frac{n}{m})^2$ of vibrating st
                   ring $$-y''=λρ(x) y,$$ with Dirichlet boundary conditions for concave densities. Our aproach is base
                   d on the method of Huang [Proc. AMS., 1999]. The main argument is to restrict the two consecutive ei
                   genfunction $y_{n-1}$ and $y_n$ between two successive zeros of $y_{n-1}$. We also prove the same re
                   sult for the Dirichlet Sturm-Liouville problems.
